    "section": "什么时候出现",
    "fromLine": 3,
    "toLine": 3,
    "text": "对局进行中断线重连；准备阶段之后几乎所有断线场景（庄家摸牌、下家摸牌、自己摸牌、首个等待、跟庄骰子）都走这里",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-097",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "一、内部依次补齐的内容 1",
    "fromLine": 7,
    "toLine": 7,
    "text": "第1步：开局数据只补数据",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-098",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "一、内部依次补齐的内容 2",
    "fromLine": 8,
    "toLine": 8,
    "text": "第2步：游戏配置，刷新自己手牌财神颜色",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-099",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "一、内部依次补齐的内容 3",
    "fromLine": 9,
    "toLine": 9,
    "text": "第3步：局数据，庄家标记、方位盘",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-100",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "一、内部依次补齐的内容 4",
    "fromLine": 10,
    "toLine": 10,
    "text": "第4步：恢复牌墙，含牌墙数据与剩余张数",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-101",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "一、内部依次补齐的内容 5",
    "fromLine": 11,
    "toLine": 11,
    "text": "恢复财神必须先于手牌，否则手牌排序时不知道财神是哪张，财神不会靠左",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-102",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "一、内部依次补齐的内容 6",
    "fromLine": 12,
    "toLine": 12,
    "text": "第6步：恢复手牌，四家手牌与副露（财神已就位）",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-103",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "一、内部依次补齐的内容 7",
    "fromLine": 13,
    "toLine": 13,
    "text": "第7步：恢复河牌，四家河牌、出牌箭头、出牌放大",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-104",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "一、内部依次补齐的内容 8",
    "fromLine": 14,
    "toLine": 14,
    "text": "第8步：恢复杭州麻将专属字段——牢庄等级、摊信息、加倍状态、飘计数、出牌限制，只补数据",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-105",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "一、内部依次补齐的内容 9",
    "fromLine": 15,
    "toLine": 15,
    "text": "权限必须晚于出牌限制：操作按钮、倒计时、头像框，并按出牌限制刷手牌置灰",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-106",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "一、内部依次补齐的内容 10",
    "fromLine": 16,
    "toLine": 16,
    "text": "第10步：恢复倒计时与方位灯、操作者头像框",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-107",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "一、内部依次补齐的内容 11",
    "fromLine": 17,
    "toLine": 17,
    "text": "若有“等待确认”，立即回应服务端",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-108",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（背景）",
    "fromLine": 23,
    "toLine": 23,
    "text": "背景显示底分、牌桌美术字、游戏中状态页",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-109",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（牌桌中央）",
    "fromLine": 24,
    "toLine": 24,
    "text": "牌桌中央显示方位盘底图、四角风向灯（含闪烁）、倒计时数字、两侧财神牌与剩余张数",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-110",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（牌桌牌面）",
    "fromLine": 25,
    "toLine": 25,
    "text": "牌桌牌面恢复四家手牌与副露、四家河牌、河牌箭头、出牌放大；财神统一染色，自己手牌财神靠左",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-111",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（玩家头像）",
    "fromLine": 26,
    "toLine": 26,
    "text": "玩家头像显示庄家标记、当前操作者的头像发光框",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-112",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（操作区）",
    "fromLine": 27,
    "toLine": 27,
    "text": "操作区显示吃碰杠胡按钮、多杠列表、操作区状态页、手牌可出与置灰",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-113",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（加倍）",
    "fromLine": 28,
    "toLine": 28,
    "text": "恢复头像与桌面的加倍标记",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-114",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（骰子）",
    "fromLine": 29,
    "toLine": 29,
    "text": "骰子保持隐藏，对局中不应显示",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-115",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "三、注意 / 风险",
    "fromLine": 33,
    "toLine": 33,
    "text": "顺序依赖一：财神必须比手牌先恢复，否则财神不靠左",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-116",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "三、注意 / 风险",
    "fromLine": 34,
    "toLine": 34,
    "text": "顺序依赖二：出牌限制必须比权限先执行，否则手牌置灰不会出现",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-117",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "三、注意 / 风险",
    "fromLine": 35,
    "toLine": 35,
    "text": "出牌限制重连时只补数据，靠“权限”这一步刷灰；若把权限也改成只补数据，置灰就会丢",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-118",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "三、注意 / 风险",
    "fromLine": 36,
    "toLine": 36,
    "text": "本流程不恢复胡牌标记与摊牌，胡牌状态重连由结算场景与回放流程负责",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-119",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/34-重连-场景动作.md",
    "section": "三、注意 / 风险",
    "fromLine": 37,
    "toLine": 37,
    "text": "倒计时与头像框按“当前操作者”恢复，重连后不会错误地落在自己身上",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-120",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/35-重连-场景结算.md",
    "section": "什么时候出现",
    "fromLine": 3,
    "toLine": 3,
    "text": "结算阶段断线后重连时出现",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-121",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/35-重连-场景结算.md",
    "section": "一、数据上记录了什么 1",
    "fromLine": 7,
    "toLine": 7,
    "text": "用结算后的累计分覆盖玩家的累计分",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-122",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/35-重连-场景结算.md",
    "section": "一、数据上记录了什么 2",
    "fromLine": 8,
    "toLine": 8,
    "text": "遍历每家本局得失分，只用于刷新头像，不单独保存",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-123",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/35-重连-场景结算.md",
    "section": "一、数据上记录了什么 3",
    "fromLine": 9,
    "toLine": 9,
    "text": "恢复加倍状态，并标记“加倍阶段已结束”",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-124",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/35-重连-场景结算.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（玩家头像分数）",
    "fromLine": 15,
    "toLine": 15,
    "text": "玩家头像分数刷新累计分",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-125",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/35-重连-场景结算.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（玩家头像分数）",
    "fromLine": 15,
    "toLine": 15,
    "text": "匹配场另外刷新匹配分数文本，含数字缩写与颜色",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-126",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/35-重连-场景结算.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（加倍标记）",
    "fromLine": 16,
    "toLine": 16,
    "text": "头像常驻加倍标记，并显示桌面加倍标签",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-127",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/35-重连-场景结算.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（加倍标记）",
    "fromLine": 16,
    "toLine": 16,
    "text": "由于标记为“已结束”，操作区收起、倒计时隐藏、桌面标签延迟 1 秒清除",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-128",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/35-重连-场景结算.md",
    "section": "三、连带影响",
    "fromLine": 20,
    "toLine": 20,
    "text": "结算界面（小结算 / 总战绩）不由这条消息打开，重连到结算阶段时依赖公共结算流程",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-129",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/35-重连-场景结算.md",
    "section": "三、连带影响",
    "fromLine": 21,
    "toLine": 21,
    "text": "本局得失分只刷新头像，没有写入桌面飘分数据，重连后桌面不再出现飘分数字（已知差异）",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-130",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/35-重连-场景结算.md",
    "section": "四、注意",
    "fromLine": 25,
    "toLine": 25,
    "text": "头像累计分与本局得失分是两个不同来源，不要混用",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-131",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/35-重连-场景结算.md",
    "section": "四、注意",
    "fromLine": 26,
    "toLine": 26,
    "text": "本消息没有“只补数据”的分支",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-132",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/36-重连-场景加倍.md",
    "section": "什么时候出现",
    "fromLine": 3,
    "toLine": 3,
    "text": "金币场在“定庄前的加倍阶段”断线后重连时出现",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-133",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/36-重连-场景加倍.md",
    "section": "一、数据上记录了什么 1",
    "fromLine": 7,
    "toLine": 7,
    "text": "第1步：开局数据只补数据",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-134",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/36-重连-场景加倍.md",
    "section": "一、数据上记录了什么 2",
    "fromLine": 8,
    "toLine": 8,
    "text": "第2步：游戏配置，刷新自己手牌财神颜色",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-135",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/36-重连-场景加倍.md",
    "section": "一、数据上记录了什么 3",
    "fromLine": 9,
    "toLine": 9,
    "text": "第3步：局数据，庄家与方位",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-136",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/36-重连-场景加倍.md",
    "section": "一、数据上记录了什么 4",
    "fromLine": 10,
    "toLine": 10,
    "text": "第4步：加倍状态，若服务端下发了加倍状态则保存并刷新界面",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-137",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/36-重连-场景加倍.md",
    "section": "一、数据上记录了什么",
    "fromLine": 12,
    "toLine": 12,
    "text": "最后若有“等待确认”，立即回应服务端",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-138",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/36-重连-场景加倍.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（玩家头像）",
    "fromLine": 18,
    "toLine": 18,
    "text": "玩家头像显示庄家标记，以及头像上的加倍常驻标记",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-139",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/36-重连-场景加倍.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（牌桌中央）",
    "fromLine": 19,
    "toLine": 19,
    "text": "牌桌中央显示方位盘底图与四角风向灯",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-140",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/36-重连-场景加倍.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（主界面操作区）",
    "fromLine": 20,
    "toLine": 20,
    "text": "自己还没选加倍时显示“加倍 / 不加倍”按钮页，并显示剩余选择倒计时",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-141",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/36-重连-场景加倍.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（桌面加倍标签）",
    "fromLine": 21,
    "toLine": 21,
    "text": "加倍进行中，桌面加倍标签显示每家状态",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-142",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/36-重连-场景加倍.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（桌面加倍标签）",
    "fromLine": 21,
    "toLine": 21,
    "text": "已结束则收起操作区、隐藏倒计时，并在 1 秒后清除桌面标签",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-143",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/36-重连-场景加倍.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（开局动画里的头像）",
    "fromLine": 22,
    "toLine": 22,
    "text": "若此时仍在开局动画阶段，开局动画里的头像同步加倍标记",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-144",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/36-重连-场景加倍.md",
    "section": "三、注意",
    "fromLine": 26,
    "toLine": 26,
    "text": "这个阶段没有手牌、河牌和权限，所以不恢复这些区域属于正常",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-145",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/36-重连-场景加倍.md",
    "section": "三、注意",
    "fromLine": 27,
    "toLine": 27,
    "text": "若服务端没有下发加倍状态，玩家重连后将看不到加倍按钮与倒计时",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-146",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/36-重连-场景加倍.md",
    "section": "三、注意",
    "fromLine": 28,
    "toLine": 28,
    "text": "排查重连问题时可留意日志会打印“加倍重连”的相关信息",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-147",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/37-重连-场景洗牌.md",
    "section": "什么时候出现",
    "fromLine": 3,
    "toLine": 3,
    "text": "洗牌阶段断线后重连时出现",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-148",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/37-重连-场景洗牌.md",
    "section": "一、内部依次补齐的内容 1",
    "fromLine": 7,
    "toLine": 7,
    "text": "第1步：开局数据只补数据",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-149",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/37-重连-场景洗牌.md",
    "section": "一、内部依次补齐的内容 2",
    "fromLine": 8,
    "toLine": 8,
    "text": "第2步：匹配场底分只补数据",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-150",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/37-重连-场景洗牌.md",
    "section": "一、内部依次补齐的内容 3",
    "fromLine": 9,
    "toLine": 9,
    "text": "第3步：游戏配置，刷新自己手牌财神颜色",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-151",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/37-重连-场景洗牌.md",
    "section": "一、内部依次补齐的内容 4",
    "fromLine": 10,
    "toLine": 10,
    "text": "第4步：局数据（庄家与方位）",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-152",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/37-重连-场景洗牌.md",
    "section": "一、内部依次补齐的内容 5",
    "fromLine": 11,
    "toLine": 11,
    "text": "第5步：骰子静态显示点数，不播放滚动",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-153",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/37-重连-场景洗牌.md",
    "section": "一、内部依次补齐的内容 6",
    "fromLine": 12,
    "toLine": 12,
    "text": "第6步：恢复牌墙，含牌墙数据与剩余张数",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-154",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/37-重连-场景洗牌.md",
    "section": "一、内部依次补齐的内容 7",
    "fromLine": 13,
    "toLine": 13,
    "text": "第7步：恢复洗牌座位数据，不重播洗牌动画",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-155",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/37-重连-场景洗牌.md",
    "section": "一、内部依次补齐的内容",
    "fromLine": 15,
    "toLine": 15,
    "text": "最后若有“等待确认”，立即回应服务端",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-156",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/37-重连-场景洗牌.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（牌桌中央）",
    "fromLine": 21,
    "toLine": 21,
    "text": "牌桌中央显示方位盘底图、四角风向灯、两枚骰子的静态点数、剩余张数",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-157",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/37-重连-场景洗牌.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（玩家头像）",
    "fromLine": 22,
    "toLine": 22,
    "text": "玩家头像显示庄家标记",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-158",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/37-重连-场景洗牌.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（自己手牌）",
    "fromLine": 23,
    "toLine": 23,
    "text": "自己手牌仅刷新财神颜色，洗牌阶段还没有手牌",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-159",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/37-重连-场景洗牌.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化（洗牌动画）",
    "fromLine": 24,
    "toLine": 24,
    "text": "重连时不播放洗牌动画",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-160",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/37-重连-场景洗牌.md",
    "section": "三、注意",
    "fromLine": 28,
    "toLine": 28,
    "text": "若希望重连时也看到洗牌动画需改动重连流程，但会连带恢复“清除预约洗牌角标”等副作用，需一起评估",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R07-161",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/37-重连-场景洗牌.md",
    "section": "三、注意",
    "fromLine": 29,
    "toLine": 29,
    "text": "骰子以“跳过动画”方式显示时不会自动隐藏，会保留到下一次对局推进把它隐藏，重连后骰子常驻属现有表现",
    "mandatory": true
  }
]
